dates late_fee v1
description "A late fee starts 14 days after an invoice falls due. Hand-written code carries the due date here from net30.cal: `ritsu check` holds the days it can be against this range, and the code that carries it is not checked"

inputs
  due_on : date  range >=2026-02-02 <=2028-12-29  fed by koyomi "net30.cal" date due

date fee_starts = due_on
  + 14 days             # the fee starts 14 days after the due date

claims
  after_the_due_date  : fee_starts > due_on
  later_due_later_fee : fee_starts is monotonic
